'''Catelyn Stark''' is the wife of Lord [[Eddard Stark]]. She is murdered at the [[Red Wedding]].

==History==
Catelyn was the elder daughter of [[Hoster Tully]] of [[Riverrun]]. She married [[Eddard Stark]] after the death of [[Brandon Stark]] in [[282 AC]].

==Recent Events==
===A Game of Thrones===
Catelyn tells Eddard of [[Jon Arryn]]'s death. She later arrests [[Tyrion Lannister]].
===A Storm of Swords===
Catelyn dies at the [[Red Wedding]] at [[The Twins]].
